        1137,
        1161
      ],
      "start": 589.64,
      "end": 599.08
    },
    {
      "en": "Our company, All4Pet, is using this data to build a database on dogs so we can understand what makes one dog healthy and another overweight, why certain conditions affect some dogs more than others.",
